{"id":6069,"path":"/anime/6069-soul-buster","updatedAt":"2026-10-28T17:37:50.005Z","info":{"title":"Soul Buster","synopsis":"Ispirata al classico cinese “Il Romanzo Dei Tre Regni”, la storia è ambientata nella moderna Cina, in cui è possibile evocare personaggi storici o di romanzi famosi tramite apposite carde. Il protagonista, il liceale Son Shin, durante un sogno rompe un sigillo che inizia a cancellare l’epoca degli stati combattenti, trovandosi al centro di una lotta tra i tre regni. Al suo fianco c’è Zhou Yu, ex generale dell’epoca, legato da qualche destino misterioso a Son Shin.","image":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/fanart/original/316049-1.jpg","poster":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/5bdec06009e43.jpg","background":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/fanart/original/316049-1.jpg","trailers":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vRCTXyltsWc"],"imdbId":"","type":"series","tags":["TV Short","Terminato","Autunno","2016"],"tagKeys":{"TV Short":"TV Short","Terminato":"Completed","Autunno":"Autumn"},"genres":["Action","Samurai"],"rating":"10.0","studio":"Studio Pierrot","episodesCount":12,"extra":{"ids":{"malId":33775,"anilistId":21661,"crunchyId":null,"disneyId":null,"netflixId":null,"primeId":null,"anilistIds":[21661],"malIds":[33775],"anidbIds":[12307],"imdbMovieIds":[],"imdbShowIds":[],"tmdbMovieIds":[],"tmdbShowIds":[68270],"tvdbMovieIds":[],"tvdbShowIds":[316049]},"stats":{"scoreRaw":"10.00","favorites":2,"members":16,"views":2716,"episodesCountRaw":12,"episodesLength":13},"flags":{"dub":0,"alwaysHome":0},"meta":{"day":"Martedì","season":"Autunno","status":"Terminato","type":"TV Short","createdAt":"2025-01-29 17:46:12","userId":2},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:21661","mal:33775"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"artworkSources":{"logo":"provider","poster":"tvdb","background":"tvdb"},"artworkCandidates":{"logo":[],"poster":[{"source":"tvdb","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/5bdec06009e43.jpg"},{"source":"provider","url":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/21661-0rjhoN3Up4Ii.jpg"},{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/316049-1.jpg"}],"background":[{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/fanart/original/316049-1.jpg"},{"source":"provider","url":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/21661-kWUuD1kqV3Sj.jpg"}]}},"related":[],"linkList":[{"title":"Episodes 1-12","titleKey":"Episodes {{start}}-{{end}}","titleParams":{"start":1,"end":12},"availabilityStatus":"available","episodesLink":"6069|1|12"}]},"episodes":[{"title":"Soul Buster","episodeNumber":1,"sourceEpisodeNumber":1,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"89944","synopsis":"Sonshin is a young high school boy in China who finds himself caught up in an ancient battle between the forces attempting to revive the emperor Kentei and who would stop them. A mysterious benefactor gives him a choice of cards, which will allow him to summon warriors from the romance of the three kingdoms to do his bidding. He summons the great general Shuuyu, but very quickly finds out that the game is more deadly than he bargained for...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/316049/5755550.jpg"},{"title":"Enlightenment","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"89945","synopsis":"Chou-sensei continues to pursue Shuuyu and Sonshin throughout the school. Sonshin lacks the spiritual power needed to fully use Shuuyu's abilities, so he has no choice but to flee. The situation grows even more dire when the two of them are trapped on the roof, and Gien destroys the fire escapes, leaving them nowhere to run...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/316049/5787995.jpg"},{"title":"Twilight","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"89946","synopsis":"Trapped on the roof, Sonshin has nowhere to run against Chou-sensei. He's forced to fight, but his spiritual power is weak. He attempts to surrender to spare Shuuyu any further pain, but as her armor glints in the setting sun, it seems he has another plan in mind...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/316049/5787996.jpg"},{"title":"Disaster","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"89947","synopsis":"With Chou-sensei defeated, the real bad guy is revealed: Hakuanshi, a servant of Kentei who was manipulating him for his own purposes. Hakuanshi uses more powerful generals, and more than just one. Even with the help of his mysterious classmate Ryofu, Sonshin has no choice but to flee. But Hakuanshi isn't willing to let him go easily...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/316049/5787997.jpg"},{"title":"Arrow","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"89948","synopsis":"Ryouun and Sonshin continue to fight against Hakuanshi's generals. Sonshin's spiritual energy is beginning to run out, and it won't be long before he's completely dry. But even after he temporarily repels this foe, he still has to deal with a reckless and angry Shuuyu, who blunders straight into a trap...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/316049/5811207.jpg"},{"title":"Ebisu","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"89950","synopsis":"Inseguiti dai Generali di Bo Anzi, Sun Chen e Ling Yun finisco in un quartiere malfamato della città, dove finiscono per scontrarsi con un gruppo di delinquenti locali, guidato da un ragazzo di nome Malin Wei. Le condizioni di Zhou Yu continuano a peggiorare.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/316049/5811208.jpg"},{"title":"Servant","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"89949","synopsis":"Giunto in prossimità del Palazzo Meridionale, il gruppo di Sun Chen viene individuato da un altro Generale al servizio di Bo Anzi. Per impedire che questi ritorni dal suo padrone con le informazioni riguardanti l'ubicazione del Palazzo, Zhou Cang, il Generale di Ling Yun, si lancia al suo inseguimento.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/316049/5811209.jpg"},{"title":"Flames","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"89952","synopsis":"Il gruppo di Sun Chen giunge finalmente al Palazzo Meridionale e finalmente riescono ad affidare Zhou Yu al nonno di Ling Yun. Tuttavia, il vecchio dice a Sun Chen che l'unico modo per salvare la ragazza è entrare all’interno del suo mondo spirituale, dove il legame tra padrone e Generale sarà messo alla prova.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/316049/5811210.jpg"},{"title":"Vow","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"89951","synopsis":"Il nonno di Ling Yun rivela a Sun Chen il segreto del Palazzo Meridionale e chiede al ragazzo di vegliare su Ling Yun quando sarà il momento di passarle il testimone di custode del luogo. Ma proprio in quel momento, Bo Anzi lancia il suo attacco.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/316049/5842346.jpg"},{"title":"Demon","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"89953","synopsis":"Dopo aver assistito alla morte del nonno, Ling Yun scatena tutta la potenza di Guan Yu contro Bo Anzi e il suo gruppo. Ma il potere del Generale è troppo grande, e la ragazza inizia a non distinguere più tra amici e nemici. Riuscirà Sun Chen a farla tornare alla ragione prima che la sua energia spirituale si esaurisca?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/316049/5842347.jpg"},{"title":"Collapse","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"89954","synopsis":"L'arrivo inaspettato di Malin Wei interrompe bruscamente i piani di Bo Anzi. Deciso fermamente a impossessarsi del potere di Guan Yu, l'uomo rinchiude il Palazzo Meridionale in una gabbia magica che ne provocherà la distruzione in poco tempo.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/316049/5842348.jpg"},{"title":"Tomorrow","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"89955","synopsis":"Rinchiusi all'interno della gabbia magica di Bo Anzi e con l'unica via di fuga bloccata da una gigantesca roccia, Sun Chen, Ling Yun e Malin Wei dovranno collaborare per riuscire a uscire vivi da questa drammatica situazione. Riusciranno a salvarsi? E dopo, cosa faranno?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/316049/5842349.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":21661,"malId":33775},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:21661","mal:33775"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12307","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21661","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"33775","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68270","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"316049","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}}]},"sourceMetadata":{"info":{"id":6069,"title":null,"title_eng":